<section class="section" aria-labelledby="message-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <h2 class="section-title" id="message-title">A note before you travel</h2>
      <div class="stack">
        <p class="section-note">
          Every country has a learning curve for first-time visitors.
          Brazil's is real — but it's navigable.
        </p>
        <p class="lead">
          Millions of tourists travel here safely every year,
          and the difference between a stressful trip and a smooth one
          usually comes down to preparation, not luck.
        </p>
        <p class="section-note">
          Brazil Decoded exists to give you that preparation —
          clearly, honestly, and before you land.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

